%% title: Checkout request
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor C as Customer
  participant W as Web storefront
  participant A as Orders API
  participant P as Payment provider
  participant D as Orders DB
  C->>W: Click "Pay"
  W->>+A: POST /orders (cart, token)
  A->>D: insert order (status=pending)
  A->>+P: charge(amount, token)
  alt charge approved
    P-->>A: 200 approved
    A->>D: update status=paid
    A-->>W: 201 Created
  else declined or timeout
    P-->>-A: 402 declined
    A->>D: update status=failed
    A-->>-W: 402 Payment required
  end
  W-->>C: Confirmation or retry prompt
